## 2. Low-Latency Audio with Oboe / AAudio

Android audio requires hardware-specific buffer tuning to prevent glitches and achieve sub-10ms round-trip latency:
* Request `AAUDIO_PERFORMANCE_MODE_LOW_LATENCY` and `AAUDIO_SHARING_MODE_EXCLUSIVE`.
* Set buffer capacity to a multiple of `oboe::AudioStream::getFramesPerBurst()`.
* Never make blocking system calls (file I/O, `malloc`, mutexes) inside the realtime audio callback `onAudioReady`.

